039740-f5972062c2f2dd3f0cd879a2.text:
===JSON_START===
{"0": "Annual revenue was KRW 105.4 billion in 2022, KRW 115.6 billion in 2023 (up 9.7% year on year), KRW 194.1 billion in 2024 (up 68.0% year on year), and KRW 146.3 billion in 2025 (down 24.6% year on year), making 2024 the largest year in the period. According to the company, annual revenue of KRW 194.0 billion in 2024 was the highest annual result since its founding. Operating profit fell from KRW 1.84 billion in 2022 to KRW 60.32 million in 2023 (down 96.7% year on year), then went through KRW 620 million in 2024 (up 923.6% year on year) to reach KRW 420 million in 2025 (down 32.0% year on year). The operating margin was 1.7% in 2022, 0.1% in 2023, 0.3% in 2024, and 0.3% in 2025. Even though revenue rose sharply in 2024, the margin stayed at around 0.3%, so top-line growth did not translate into profitability. Net income attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 3.35 billion in 2022, KRW 2.0 billion in 2023 (down 40.3% year on year), KRW 3.6 billion in 2024 (up 80.2% year on year), and KRW 2.15 billion in 2025 (down 40.3% year on year). Net income including non-controlling interests was KRW 1.75 billion in 2025, which should be viewed separately from net income attributable to controlling shareholders. At the end of 2025, total equity was KRW 52.9 billion, of which KRW 52.0 billion was attributable to controlling shareholders, and total liabilities were KRW 58.5 billion. The debt-to-equity ratio rose from 80.2% in 2022 to 110.7% in 2025. Operating cash flow was highest in 2024 at KRW 9.89 billion and was KRW 3.25 billion in 2025. In the quarterly trend, revenue of KRW 38.2 billion in Q3 2025 fell to KRW 25.0 billion in Q4 2025 (down 34.7% quarter on quarter), then jumped to KRW 170.7 billion in Q1 2026 (up 584.2% quarter on quarter). Revenue in Q2 2026 was KRW 62.9 billion (down 63.2% quarter on quarter), and Q3 was KRW 71.3 billion (up 13.3% quarter on quarter and up 86.5% year on year). This sharp swing appears to be the result of contract volumes from 2025 being recognized in a concentrated way in Q1. Operating profit of KRW 36.18 million in Q3 2025 turned into an operating loss of KRW 180 million in Q4 2025 (a swing to a loss from the previous quarter), and then was KRW 1.07 billion in Q1 2026, KRW 450 million in Q2, and KRW 2.22 billion in Q3. Net income attributable to controlling shareholders was a net loss of KRW 38.26 million in Q3 2025, KRW 2.5 billion in Q4 (a swing to profit from the previous quarter), KRW 730 million in Q1 2026, KRW 1.18 billion in Q2, and KRW 2.04 billion in Q3. The fact that net income attributable to controlling shareholders came to KRW 2.5 billion in Q4 2025 despite an operating loss is a point where the influence of non-operating items, such as non-operating income and expenses, should also be examined. On a company-reported basis, cumulative revenue for the first half of 2026 was KRW 233.6 billion and operating profit was KRW 1.5 billion.", "1": "Downstream demand is supported by expanding hardware investment, such as servers and storage, in line with the digital transformation trend. That hardware demand is rising alongside the acceleration of digital transformation is the assessment of a technical analysis report from February 2022. Industry data after that point is not sufficiently covered in this report, so the current position in the demand cycle needs to be checked separately against up-to-date industry data. The company recently declared that it would transform itself into an AI infrastructure specialist, going beyond its existing IT distribution and infrastructure business. In terms of its standing within its sector, it ranks in the lower middle range by operating margin among the 95 stocks in the electronic equipment/instruments sector. Its market capitalization and revenue size are also in the lower-middle range within the sector. In the competitive landscape, the company's differentiator is that it combines a vendor master-distributor structure with its own software lineup. However, because revenue scale varies with large government-led projects, the stability of the order pipeline is the key factor when compared with peer distributors. There are expectations that, as references from large projects accumulate, securing references through these results will help drive the restructuring of its business. Conversely, project-based revenue swings widely from quarter to quarter, so the timing of individual contracts, rather than the industry cycle, determines quarterly results.", "2": "The company has indicated its direction of maintaining a growth trend in the second half of 2026 as well, continuing to enhance shareholder value and set new earnings records. A direction has been presented, but the specific numerical targets that can be confirmed in public materials are limited. Because revenue in Q2 2026 fell from the previous quarter, revenue in Q4 2026 and in 2027 depends on the size and recognition timing of new orders. An order disclosure has already been made on May 26, 2026, in the form of a Single Sales/Supply Contract Execution filing, so the frequency of disclosures of large contracts serves as an indicator of the earnings trend. On the business side, there is a plan to secure a new revenue model through its own software, such as an enterprise private AI chatbot and an AI appliance. The share of revenue and profit that this new business accounts for is not yet sufficiently visible in the disclosed results. Given the precedent that the Q4 2025 results disclosure came out on March 19, 2026, the annual report containing full-year 2026 results is likely to be filed in March 2027. At that point, the financial points to check are how operating cash flow and the debt-to-equity ratio have changed from their 2025 levels. It is also necessary to look at whether the operating margin stays at around 0.3% and whether quarterly profits carry through to the full year. How quickly revenue is backfilled by other orders after the large projects is the key variable for the 2027 trend."}
===JSON_END===

032080-fe683b80f771693a89b9e744.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bear": [{"title": {"ko": "영업손실 지속과 순손실 확대", "en": "Persistent operating losses and a wider net loss"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 1분기부터 3분기까지 영업손실은 10.8억원, 14.5억원, 8.8억원으로 3개 분기 연속 이어졌다. 3분기 지배주주 순손실은 31억원으로 적자 전환했다. 최근 4개 분기 지배주주 순손실 합계는 40억원이다. 3분기 매출이 2개 분기 연속 늘었지만 이익 개선으로는 이어지지 않았다.", "en": "Operating losses were KRW 1.08 billion in Q1 2026, KRW 1.45 billion in Q2 and KRW 884 million in Q3, three consecutive loss-making quarters. Net loss attributable to controlling shareholders reached KRW 3.1 billion in Q3 2026, a swing into loss. The four-quarter total of such net losses through Q3 2026 is KRW 4 billion. Two straight quarters of sales growth did not yet translate into earnings recovery."}}, {"title": {"ko": "매출 3년 연속 감소와 소비 부진", "en": "Three years of falling sales and weak consumption"}, "body": {"ko": "고물가와 경기 둔화로 소비심리가 위축되며 패션시장 성장세가 약화됐다는 평가가 나왔다. 2026년 1분기 실적 악화는 프로모션과 직물 부문에서 두드러졌다. 내수 의존도가 높은 구조는 소비 둔화가 길어질 경우 실적 회복을 늦출 수 있다.", "en": "Commentary pointed to high prices and a slowing economy weakening consumer sentiment and growth in the fashion market. The Q1 2026 deterioration was concentrated in the promotion and fabric segments. A structure that depends on domestic demand could delay a recovery if the consumption slowdown lasts."}}, {"title": {"ko": "대주주 지분 집중과 낮은 유동성", "en": "Concentrated ownership and limited float"}, "body": {"ko": "최대주주와 특별관계자 지분은 43.61%로 보고됐다. 유동주식 비율은 56.39%로 집계돼 시장에서 거래 가능한 물량은 제한적이다. 시가총액 규모가 작아 주가 변동성이 커질 수 있다. 2023년에는 배당이 없었고, 배당 재개가 확정되기 전까지 주주에게 현금으로 돌아가는 보상은 제한적이다.", "en": "The largest shareholder and related parties reported holding 43.61%. The free float is reported at 56.39%, which limits the number of shares available to trade. The company's small market capitalization can lead to larger share price swings. No dividend was paid for 2023, and cash returns to shareholders remain limited until a dividend restart is confirmed."}}]}
===JSON_END===

105550-d8b45f0981d441f389760a89.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bear": [{"title": {"ko": "영업손실 확대와 현금흐름 적자 지속", "en": "Widening operating losses and continued negative cash flow"}, "body": {"ko": "영업손실은 2022년 20.5억원에서 2025년 155억원으로 커졌고 영업이익률은 -42.7%였다. 영업활동 현금흐름은 2025년 -125억원으로 적자 폭이 커졌다. 2026년 3분기 영업손실은 29.5억원으로 줄었지만 5개 분기 연속 적자다.", "en": "The operating loss widened from KRW 2.05 billion in 2022 to KRW 15.5 billion in 2025, with an operating margin of -42.7%. Operating cash flow deteriorated to KRW -12.5 billion in 2025. The third-quarter 2026 operating loss narrowed to KRW 2.95 billion, but losses have persisted for five consecutive quarters."}}, {"title": {"ko": "흑자의 질과 분기 실적의 변동성", "en": "Quality of profit and volatility in quarterly results"}, "body": {"ko": "2025년 흑자 전환은 보도에 따르면 영업외 요인인 타법인 주식 처분이익의 영향이 컸다. 2026년 2분기 지배주주 순손실은 172억원으로 영업손실 60.6억원보다 훨씬 컸다. 분기 손익의 방향이 자주 바뀌어 이익 회복의 지속성은 아직 확인되지 않았다.", "en": "Reports indicate the 2025 turnaround owed much to non-operating gains such as disposal gains on equity stakes in other companies. In the second quarter of 2026, the net loss attributable to controlling shareholders was KRW 17.2 billion, well above the KRW 6.06 billion operating loss. Quarterly earnings have swung in direction, so the durability of any recovery has not yet been established."}}, {"title": {"ko": "조달 부담과 희석, 계약 해지", "en": "Funding burden, dilution and a terminated supply contract"}, "body": {"ko": "507억 6,500만원 규모 유상증자는 30% 할인된 발행가액으로 1,100만주를 발행하는 구조다. 18회차 전환사채 100억원도 결정됐다. 퀀텀레드미니 공급계약은 2026년 4월 30일자로 해지되어 미이행 수주 잔고 108억원의 공급이 중단됐다. 회사는 공시 번복에 따른 불성실공시 지정 가능성에 대해서도 점검해야 하는 상황이다.", "en": "The KRW 50.76 billion rights offering issues 11 million new shares at a 30% discount to the reference price. An 18th series convertible bond of KRW 10 billion was also decided. The Quantum Redmini supply contract was terminated effective April 30, 2026, halting supply against an unfulfilled order balance of KRW 10.8 billion. The termination also raises the possibility of an unfaithful-disclosure designation tied to a reversal of earlier disclosure."}}]}
===JSON_END===

110020-4ca61bd2fdb7752e22c6f602.text:
===JSON_START===
{"keypoints": [{"ko": "2024년 영업이익 11.6억원으로 흑자 전환한 뒤 2025년 영업손실 3.4억원으로 적자 전환했다. 2025년 4분기부터 2026년 3분기까지 4개 분기 연속 영업손실이다.", "en": "Operating profit of KRW 1.16 billion in 2024 turned into an operating loss of KRW 343 million in 2025, and losses have continued for four straight quarters since the fourth quarter of 2025."}, {"ko": "2026년 상반기 매출은 58억 2,200만원으로 전년 동기보다 소폭 늘었지만, 영업손실은 4억 6,000만원으로 적자 폭이 커졌다.", "en": "First-half 2026 revenue was KRW 5.822 billion, slightly up year on year, while the operating loss widened to KRW 460 million."}, {"ko": "약 10억원을 투입한 홈케어 자동화 설비가 2026년 4분기부터 가동된 것으로 보도됐고, 신규 설비의 공급 물량은 연간 50억원 이상으로 추정된다.", "en": "A home-care automation line built with about KRW 1 billion was reported to start commercial operation in the fourth quarter of 2026, with estimated annual supply capacity above KRW 5 billion."}, {"ko": "2027년 매출 목표는 2025년 공시 매출 137억원을 크게 웃도는 수준이다.", "en": "The 2027 revenue target is well above the KRW 13.7 billion disclosed for 2025."}, {"ko": "2025년 말 부채총계는 11억원, 부채비율은 6.3%로 재무 부담은 낮은 편이다. 반면 영업이익률은 2025년 -2.5%로 수익성 회복이 과제다.", "en": "Total liabilities were KRW 1.1 billion and the debt ratio was 6.3% at the end of 2025, so the financial burden is low, while the operating margin of -2.5% in 2025 leaves profitability recovery as the central task."}], "bear": [{"title": {"ko": "4개 분기 연속 영업손실", "en": "Four straight quarters of operating losses"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 3분기 영업손실은 3.3억원으로 전년 동기 대비 적자로 전환됐다. 2026년 상반기 매출총이익률도 22.2%로 전년 동기 25.8%보다 낮아졌다. 손실 축소 흐름이 이어지지 않은 점이 약세 요인이다.", "en": "The third-quarter loss of KRW 328 million turned from a year-earlier profit. First-half 2026 gross margin of 22.2% was below the 25.8% of a year earlier. The failure of losses to keep narrowing is the central bear point."}}, {"title": {"ko": "매출 회복과 손실 축소의 불일치", "en": "Revenue recovery not matched by narrower losses"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 3분기 매출은 전 분기보다 16.7% 늘었지만 전년 동기보다 23.1% 적다. 매출이 늘어나는 구간에서도 영업손실 폭은 2분기와 3분기에 다시 커졌다. 매출 회복 속도가 수익성 회복으로 이어지지 않고 있다는 것이 약세 쪽 해석이다.", "en": "Third-quarter 2026 revenue rose 16.7% from the prior quarter but was 23.1% below a year earlier. Even as revenue grew, operating losses widened in the second and third quarters. The bear reading is that the pace of sales recovery has not carried through to profitability."}}, {"title": {"ko": "외부 변수와 원가 부담", "en": "External shocks and cost pressure"}, "body": {"ko": "지정학적 리스크에 따른 원·부자재 수급 차질이 생산과 공급에 영향을 줬다는 것이 밸류파인더의 추정이다. 이 분석은 일시적 부담으로 보았지만, 외부 요인이 해소되지 않으면 원가 구조가 개선되기 어렵다. 상반기 매출총이익률 하락도 원가 압력이 남아 있다는 신호로 볼 수 있다.", "en": "An outside research firm estimated that supply disruptions of raw and sub-materials tied to geopolitical risk affected production and supply, and called it temporary. If external factors persist, cost structure improvement may be slow. The lower first-half gross margin can also be read as a sign that cost pressure remains."}}]}
===JSON_END===

085810-6a35eb3ba8fc7a78ba74f16f.text:
===JSON_START===
{"bear": [{"title": {"ko": "3개 분기 연속 영업손실", "en": "Three straight quarters of operating losses"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 1분기 영업손실 10.9억원, 2분기 2.7억원, 3분기 17.5억원으로 3개 분기 연속 영업손실이다. 3분기에는 전 분기 대비 손실이 확대됐고 전년 동기 대비 적자로 전환됐다.", "en": "Operating losses were KRW 1.09 billion in the first quarter of 2026, KRW 268 million in the second, and KRW 1.75 billion in the third, making three straight quarters. The third-quarter loss widened from the prior quarter and turned from profit to loss versus the same quarter of the prior year."}}, {"title": {"ko": "영업활동 현금흐름의 지속적 마이너스", "en": "Continued negative operating cash flow"}, "body": {"ko": "2025년에 영업이익 흑자 전환이 이뤄졌음에도 현금이 유출됐다는 점이 약세 요인이다.", "en": "Cash still flowed out in 2025 despite the return to operating profit, which is a weakness."}}, {"title": {"ko": "주식 수 증가와 상장 유지 우려", "en": "Share count increase and listing maintenance concerns"}, "body": {"ko": "2026년 11월 4일 발행된 제3자배정 신주 1,231,404주가 11월 17일 상장돼 보통주 총수가 15,368,357주가 됐다. 시가총액은 11월 11일 기준 25거래일 연속 200억원 미만으로 관리종목 지정 우려가 공시됐다. 신주 발행가는 1주당 1,210원이었다.", "en": "The 1,231,404 new shares issued through a third-party allotment on November 4, 2026 were listed on November 17, bringing common shares outstanding to 15,368,357. Market capitalization was below KRW 20 billion for 25 straight trading days as of November 11, and an administrative issue designation risk was disclosed. The new shares were issued at KRW 1,210 each."}}]}
===JSON_END===

066910-7abcf9fcd2acaf1b6e8d0507.text:
